) and symptoms text get filled. Remaining sections (Description/Expected Behaviour, Steps to Reproduce, Investigation/Root Cause, Resolution Plan, Timeline, Appendix) stay as raw placeholder text like [What should happen]. Agents are told to follow up with manage_docs replace_section calls but consistently skip this step, leaving incomplete bug reports. The workflow is...; timestamp=2026-02-01 23:48:57 UTC; title=open_bug template population incomplete - agents skip follow-up edits; priority=medium; log_type=doc_updates; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/DOC_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-01T23:48:57.308547+00:00_71685a54", "timestamp": "2026-02-01T23:48:57.308644+00:00"}
