{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-01 23:59:48 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] Created bug report: report.md | action=create; actual_behavior=query_entries silently returns no results when searching for entries by other agents. Root cause: Lines 1079-1086 merge the `agent` parameter (caller identity) into the `agents` filter list (search criteria). This causes every query to be implicitly filtered to \"only show entries written by the calling agent\", making cross-agent searches impossible.; affected_areas=[\"tools/query_entries.py\"]; affected_paths=[\"tools/query_entries.py\"]; agent_id=Scribe; agent_name=Scribe; case_id=BUG-2026-02-01-0002; category=logic; doc=bug_report; doc_type=bug; document_type=bug_report; file_path=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/docs/bugs/logic/2026-02-01_BUG-2026-02-01-0002/report.md; file_size=2608; project_name=query_enhancement_suite; project_root=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp; reported_at=2026-02-01 23:59:48 UTC; reporter=BugHunter-QueryAudit; section=; severity=medium; slug=BUG-2026-02-01-0002; status=INVESTIGATING; summary_long=query_entries silently returns no results when searching for entries by other agents. Root cause: Lines 1079-1086 merge the `agent` parameter (caller identity) into the `agents` filter list (search criteria). This causes every query to be implicitly filtered to \"only show entries written by the calling agent\", making cross-agent searches impossible.; symptoms=query_entries silently returns no results when searching for entries by other agents. Root cause: Lines 1079-1086 merge the `agent` parameter (caller identity) into the `agents` filter list (search criteria). This causes every query to be implicitly filtered to \"only show entries written by the calling agent\", making cross-agent searches impossible.; timestamp=2026-02-01 23:59:48 UTC; title=query_entries contaminating agents filter with caller identity; priority=medium; log_type=doc_updates; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/DOC_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-01T23:59:48.833822+00:00_55004f51", "timestamp": "2026-02-01T23:59:48.833875+00:00"}
{"op": "commit", "ref_id": "2026-02-01T23:59:48.833822+00:00_55004f51", "timestamp": "2026-02-01T23:59:48.845923+00:00"}
