{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-02 00:37:41 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: query_enhancement_suite] Created bug report: report.md | action=create; actual_behavior=Bug reports created via open_bug contain raw Jinja template syntax ({% extends %}, {{ variables }}) instead of rendered markdown. Files are byte-for-byte identical to BUG_REPORT_TEMPLATE.md template file.; affected_areas=[\"template_engine/engine.py\", \"tools/manage_docs.py\"]; affected_paths=[\"template_engine/engine.py\", \"tools/manage_docs.py\"]; agent_id=Scribe; agent_name=Scribe; case_id=BUG-2026-02-02-0001; category=infrastructure; component=template_engine; customer_impact=All bug reports since Feb 2026 are unusable - contain raw template code instead of actual bug documentation; doc=bug_report; doc_type=bug; document_type=bug_report; environment=local; expected_behavior=Bug reports should be rendered via Jinja2 with proper YAML frontmatter, populated fields, and markdown structure; file_path=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/docs/bugs/infrastructure/2026-02-02_BUG-2026-02-02-0001/report.md; file_size=3797; immediate_actions=Fix _render_legacy_template to raise exception instead of returning raw template (line 392). Investigate WHY Jinja rendering fails in MCP context when standalone tests work perfectly.; project_name=query_enhancement_suite; project_root=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp; reported_at=2026-02-02 00:37:41 UTC; reporter=BugHunter-TemplateRender; reproduction_steps=[\"Call open_bug() to create bug report\", \"Check docs/bugs/\\\\<category\\\\>/\\\\<date\\\\>_\\\\<slug\\\\>/report.md\", \"File contains raw {% extends %} and {{ }} syntax\"]; root_cause=Template engine fallback returns raw template string when legacy rendering fails (engine.py:392). Jinja rendering fails with TemplateSyntaxError/TemplateRuntimeError, triggering legacy fallback, which can't process Jinja syntax and returns unprocessed template.; section=; severity=critical; slug=BUG-2026-02-02-0001; status=INVESTIGATING; summary_long=Bug reports created via open_bug contain raw Jinja template syntax ({% extends %}, {{ variables }}) instead of rendered markdown. Files are byte-for-byte identical to BUG_REPORT_TEMPLATE.md template file.; symptoms=Bug reports created via open_bug contain raw Jinja template syntax ({% extends %}, {{ variables }}) instead of rendered markdown. Files are byte-for-byte identical to BUG_REPORT_TEMPLATE.md template file.; timestamp=2026-02-02 00:37:41 UTC; title=Template rendering returns raw Jinja source instead of rendered output; priority=medium; log_type=doc_updates; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/query_enhancement_suite/DOC_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-02T00:37:41.800444+00:00_79515225", "timestamp": "2026-02-02T00:37:41.800514+00:00"}
